WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.360
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.740
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.330
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.830
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.420
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:29.050
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.640
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:40.310
by ridding you...

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:43.480
...of your other love?

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:48.060
At sunset,

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.570
when the children go home,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.490
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:58.410
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:00.490
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:04.290
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.800
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.350
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:24.850
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:32.030 --> 00:01:35.030
I'm Kurata Sana, a 6th
grader and TV personality.

00:01:35.030 --> 00:01:38.360
My beloved Mama is a novelist.
The chipmunk on her head is Maro-chan.

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:41.700
My former boyfriend, Rei-kun.
Now, he's a fine manager.

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:43.040
The mysterious straight man, Babbit.

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:44.870
My measurements are,
starting from the top, 8-...

00:01:45.370 --> 00:01:47.960
Hayama Akito, my natural
enemy and good friend.

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:51.040
The actress Asako Kurumi-san.
She's Rei-kun's girlfriend.

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:53.590
But these two are hiding the fact
that they're seeing each other.

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:57.050
Listen to this, listen to this!
Zenjiro-sensei, you see...

00:01:58.050 --> 00:02:00.220
...thought up this plan to
program-jack other shows

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:01.970
in order to promote "Child's Toy"!

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:04.720
We're suddenly going to crash other shows,

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:06.560
show up on their cameras
without their permission,

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:08.390
and go around advertising "Child's Toy."

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:11.060
Then, we're going to say
"gotcha!" and run away!

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:15.070
Isn't that funny? Huh? Isn't that funny?
Right? Right? Isn't that funny? Huh?

00:02:15.070 --> 00:02:17.400
Hey, Rei-kun, the light is green!

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:21.910
Hey, it's green! Green! Green!
Green, I say, I say, I say! It's green!!

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:22.830
"Seat belt"

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:31.080
"My Boyfriend Has To Grin and Bear It"

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:35.210
That was dangerous.

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:38.380
Luckily, you didn't cause any
harm to other cars or pedestrians.

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:40.050
S- sorry.

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:41.640
I know it's a hackneyed expression,

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:44.390
but if you could get by with just saying
you're sorry, we wouldn't need the police.

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:45.390
Sorry.

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:48.390
What were you thinking, taking your
eyes off the road while driving?

00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:49.230
I'm terribly sorry.

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:50.850
Don't go looking away again
right after what I just said!

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:51.900
Don't do it! Don't do it! Don't do it!

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:54.020
"Rei-kun, why were you looking away?"

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:54.070
Fidget, fidget...

00:02:54.070 --> 00:02:56.070
I used to be such a big fan of his, too.

00:02:56.070 --> 00:02:58.070
It sure is a shock, huh? I mean, Kim-Kim...

00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:00.070
Actors are all like that, aren't they?

00:03:00.070 --> 00:03:02.240
Ah, what a shock!

00:03:04.080 --> 00:03:08.410
W- where's the harm in letting
Babbit join in with everyone else?

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:10.420
Good morning!

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:23.090
"Study Hall"

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:12.750
You'll have to excuse me.
Rei-kun got into an accident,

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:16.090
so I had to ride the train,
and before I knew it, I was late!

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:20.090
Yow! Sensei, you sure are strict, huh?

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:23.090
Sana-chan, the teacher isn't here.
She said to have study hall for an hour.

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:24.430
Lucky!

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:26.430
I'm going to dance the "I'm Saved Mambo"!

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:28.100
Sana-chan, did you know about this?

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:28.980
What, what?

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:32.060
"From the heralded drama
'Kiss of an Angel' comes true love."

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:34.730
"Kimuchi Takuya and Kurumi Asako
have discovered a burning passion"!?

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:36.480
"After secret midnight rendezvous,

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:38.610
true love springs from
their roles as lovers"!?

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:43.070
What is this!?

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:45.070
This is the train.

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:48.080
Is it okay if we go to the studio
by train until the car is fixed?

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:49.750
That doesn't matter to me.

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:53.420
Rei-kun, why have you been making nothing
but sideways glances since this morning?

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:54.420
No I haven't...

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:56.790
Yes you have! See? See?

00:03:57.750 --> 00:04:01.760
So that's why. I guess that article
has been on your mind, too, Rei-kun.

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:05.090
It's so maddening! That article
is a load of lies and hooey!

00:04:05.090 --> 00:04:09.770
Asako-san wouldn't fall for that showy
actor, after all, right? Right? Right?

00:04:09.770 --> 00:04:13.440
After all... after all, you're
Asako-san's boyfriend, Rei-kun-

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:16.110
I- it's just a rumor, so you don't
have to concern yourself with it.

00:04:16.110 --> 00:04:16.770
What's going on there?

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:18.520
He looks like a dangerous man.

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:22.110
No, I was just... you see...

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:24.280
This girl here is the Kurata Sana-chan!

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:28.370
Sana-chan!?

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:34.330
Okay then, with that, please
be sure to watch "Child's Toy"!

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:41.050
Rei-kun being both my manager and
boyfriend was a long time ago.

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:45.720
Yeah. I stepped aside so that
Rei-kun could have Asako-san.

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:46.840
Ah, you're heavy!

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:49.720
I'm sorry, Rei-kun!

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:52.140
I- it's okay, Sana-chan.

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:54.190
"Pretty humiliating, Rei-kun!"

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:57.400
Asako-san has a new boyfriend!?

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:59.070
I told you, it's just a rumor.

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:00.730
Have you checked it with Asako-san?

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:02.070
W-well...

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:06.070
The world of show business is filled with
nothing but good-looking, handsome people.

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:08.070
You look silly right now.

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:11.410
If you space off, then wham, Asako-san
will be taken away from you like that!

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:14.410
Aren't you worried about that!? Hmm?

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:15.410
Well...

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:20.090
Rei-kun, you are the most handsome,
but if you haven't seen her in a long time,

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:22.420
there's no telling what will happen!
Are you seeing her regularly?

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:24.090
No, not lately...

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:26.760
You haven't seen her!?

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:28.930
That's no good! Dangerous! Super-risky!

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:31.390
At this point, you should hold
a press conference and announce it!

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:33.680
"I am Kurumi Asako's boyfriend."

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:34.350
Like that!

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:35.730
I can't do that!

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:38.400
Why?! How come!? For what reason!?

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:41.400
Until the day when she becomes
a full-fledged actress...

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:45.070
and until the day when I become
a full-fledged manager...

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:48.410
Until then... until then...

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:51.080
Sana-chan, we're just about ready for you!

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:52.200
Okay!

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:55.960
Rei-kun is being pretty wussy today.

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:09.430
Wow, look at all of the press corps!

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:10.720
Well, shua.

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:13.100
With awl the rumuhs about Kimuchi Takuya,

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:15.770
they want to find an
opening to intuhview him.

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:17.060
It's time we got going.

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:19.270
Mm-hmm, here goes!

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:22.110
"Child's Toy"!

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:25.110
Come on, come on, "Child's Toy"!
Watch "Child's Toy"!

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:27.780
Zenjiro-san, what's going on?

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:29.070
Little of this, little of that...

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:30.070
Little bit of armpit!

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:31.120
No there's not!

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:35.040
This show has been taken over
by those of us from "Child's Toy"!

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:37.710
Come on, come on, "Child's Toy"!
Watch "Child's Toy"!

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:40.540
The group "SNYAP", now at
the height of popularity...

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:42.710
Among them is a man who is receiving
acclaim not just for his songs,

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:46.050
but for his work in dramas, too-
Kim-Tak himself, Kimuchi Takuya.

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:49.050
Sure, he may be handsome,
but that's all he is.

00:06:52.050 --> 00:06:53.390
Are you okay, Sana-chan?

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:54.850
Just embarrassed.

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:56.390
H- he's kind...

00:06:56.390 --> 00:07:00.730
Ready? You do this, then this,
then you say "It's Kim-Kim!"

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:03.060
He tells jokes, too!

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:05.230
His sense of humor leaves
something to be desired, though.

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:07.070
This is dreadful. Kimuchi Takuya...

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:09.400
He's handsome, he's kind, and he's funny.

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:12.740
He has all three of the critical
elements for getting girls!

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:16.240
I- it can't be true...

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:19.830
"Kiss of an Angel"

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:24.090
Asako would be the last
one to do such a thing...

00:07:24.090 --> 00:07:26.170
Yeah! No worries.

00:07:29.590 --> 00:07:32.010
Hey... They'll be mad
at you if they saw that!

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:33.010
Okay, good work, everyone!

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:35.510
Excuse us! One moment, please!

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:38.020
That hurt.

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:41.020
I've got a location shoot for a movie,
so if you'll excuse me...

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:42.480
Kimuchi-kun, a word, please!

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:44.360
What's going on between
you and Kurumi Asako-san?

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:46.820
Do you have the same love for her
as your character in the drama does?

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:53.530
Sana-chan...

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:56.700
You're sure you're not worried, Rei-kun?

00:07:56.700 --> 00:08:02.040
Yeah. This drama is a very
important job to her as an actress.

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:07.040
I'm just not seeing her so that
she can concentrate on her work.

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:09.380
I'm not worried about any rumors.

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:10.760
I see...

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:17.720
Rule for being a manager
number 1: Safe driving.

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:21.060
I just took my eyes off the road
for a moment. I won't do it again.

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:23.350
Sana is your meal ticket, right?

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:26.060
You got into that accident
because your attention wandered!

00:08:26.060 --> 00:08:28.730
Right now, you're going to retrain
yourself from the beginning!

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:30.740
Oh, and I buried a landmine over there.

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:34.030
Okay, one more lap!

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:35.700
Oh, there's a landmine right there, too.

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:39.040
I wonder if Rei-kun
really is worried after all.

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:41.790
It wouldn't hurt to ask
Asako-san really quick, would it?

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:46.880
3-3-0-9-8-7-4...

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:50.380
Hello?

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:52.050
Ah, Asako-san?

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:55.720
Sana-chan? It's been too long!
Sorry, but I'm out on location right now.

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:58.050
Huh? Rei? Is he doing okay?

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:00.060
Asako-san, if you would...

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:01.720
Asako-chan, hurry!

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:03.060
Right!

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:06.020
Sorry, but we're about to do a take. Bye.

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:09.400
Just a minute, Asako-san!

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:11.400
She hung up on you pretty abruptly, huh?

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:12.740
I- it can't be...

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:14.570
Is that how it is?

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:19.700
"Save Rei-kun!!"

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:21.740
You should just leave it alone.

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:24.750
I can't! You could at least
feel a little sorry for him!

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:27.080
He told you himself not to
worry about it, didn't he?

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:29.420
You don't suppose that
Takuya-kun and Asako-san

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:31.090
really are in love with each other...?

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:34.670
I don't know. I don't think that
Asako-san is that kind of person,

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:39.680
but Asako-san hasn't seen Rei-kun at all.
Takuya-kun sees her every day on location!

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:41.680
If I think about it too much, my head
is going to pop like a sea urchin!

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:45.230
"Sea Urchin Head"

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:45.230
"Sand Dollar"

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:45.350
Eh? That's a good look for you.

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:48.690
Let's tail Takuya-kun and
Asako-san to find out the truth!

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:52.360
That's a fairly extreme
proposal, coming from you.

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:55.860
W- well, I used to be something
of a fan of Asako-san before,

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:57.700
so I was thinking maybe
I might actually meet her...

00:09:57.700 --> 00:10:00.120
Hey, Tsuyoshi-kun, you've got Aya-chan!

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:04.370
Tsuyoshi-kun, you're
a fan of Asako-san, huh?

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:07.040
N- no, that was along time ago!
Along time ago!

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:08.710
Is that right?

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:13.710
All right! Why don't we
investigate those two!?

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:15.050
You really don't have to wear that outfit.

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:17.130
The girl is style first, substance later.

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:19.890
You go on ahead.

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:19.760
"Enter the Great Detective,
Kurata Sana!! (and Hayama, Tsuyoshi)"

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:23.180
Cut! Okay, nice job!

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:28.730
This is Sana. They appear
to have finished shooting. Over.

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:31.270
I can't see very well from here. Over.

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:34.530
This is idiotic. Let's go home, now. Over.

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:36.650
In any case, let's
split up and stand watch.

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:39.030
Scatter!

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:40.200
Over.

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:45.040
Tomorrow, we finally shoot the
climactic kiss scene! The big smooch!

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:46.330
Right.

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:49.330
K- kiss scene!?

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:51.210
This is Tsuyoshi... This is Tsuyoshi...

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:55.670
This is Sana. Give me
a situation report. Over.

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:58.720
They appear to be
talking to each other. Over.

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:01.720
They seem to really be
getting along well. Over.

00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:03.680
Oh no, I'm so nervous.

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:06.680
So am I. But it will be okay.

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:10.020
Whoa, he's touching her! He has
the audacity to touch her! Over.

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:12.020
Oh, they're closing in.

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:13.690
They're closing in. Over.

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:16.730
Aw, shut up! I can see that
just by looking at them!

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:20.360
Hey! I can't see!

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:21.570
Over!

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:25.780
O-ba-na...

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:35.210
Hey! I can't see!

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:37.880
Waugh, let me see! Give me a peek!
What's the problem, lady!?

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:39.880
Hold on, what am I saying!?

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:43.260
I wanted you to have
a look at it, too, Asako-san.

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:45.220
Of course I will!
I'll go together with you.

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:47.220
Hey, what are they talking about!?

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:50.810
He said he wanted Asako-san
to see it, too. Over.

00:11:51.560 --> 00:11:53.940
She said "Of course. I will
go together with you." Over.

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:58.780
Go with him to look at something!? Where!?
Where!? Where!? Where are they going!?

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:00.900
Calm down.

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:02.280
Don't get so agitated.

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:04.820
Y- you think I can stay calm
over something like this!?

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:06.740
No, that's impossible!
That's quite impossible, sir!

00:12:06.740 --> 00:12:08.290
After all, Asako-san is there
having secret conversations,

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:09.620
and leaving Rei-kun out of them!

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:10.910
And if I can't get agitated
over something like that-

00:12:10.960 --> 00:12:13.960
This is no time to be bickering! Over.

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:14.960
Oh, right.

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:17.630
Begging your pardon, but would you
please let us snap a two-shot of you?

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:19.000
Eh? Um...

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:20.590
A two-shot, huh?

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:23.800
Okay!

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:27.640
Whoa, this is bad!

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:32.600
Once that picture gets around,
Rei-kun will be hurt to pieces!

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:34.270
What do we do!?
What do we do!?

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:37.060
If Asako-san and Kimuchi-kun
really are in love...

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:39.570
What good will it do if you panic?

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:41.400
Do you usually use a chop on girls!?

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:43.070
Don't worry, I'm using
the back of the blade.

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:44.570
Where is the back of the blade of a chop?

00:12:44.570 --> 00:12:47.570
Okay, everyone, good job!
Let's keep it up tomorrow, too!

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:48.910
Well, if you'll excuse us...

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:49.580
J- just a minute!

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:51.910
--Kimuchi-kun!
--Is it true that you actors have
teeth made of white cypress?

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:53.910
You really are good at giving
reporters the slip, huh?

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:55.250
I've had a lot of practice.

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:56.920
Never mind them, you want to go see it now?

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:58.250
Right now?

00:12:58.250 --> 00:12:59.920
Aah! Those two!

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:02.590
That's acting suspicious if I ever saw it!

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:06.430
This is Tsuyoshi! I'm getting to
Kimuchi-kun's car ahead of them! Over.

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:10.600
All right, Tsuyoshi-kun,
well done! Here we come!

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:14.350
Geez, would you try keeping up with
yourself sometime, for crying out loud?

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:16.980
How do you do that!?
How are you doing that!?

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:23.280
Wow, Kimuchi-kun, you sure are bold.
I mean, a two-shot photo?

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:24.950
It's okay.

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:26.610
It's not okay.

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:31.120
Shouldn't you be acting a little
more prudent before the wedding?

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:32.580
W- wedding!?

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:34.870
Did you just say something?

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:37.370
Huh? Not me.
Maybe you imagined it?

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:39.880
No, Sana-chan, you can't yell like that.

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:42.210
Click...

00:13:44.210 --> 00:13:49.220
♪ Forbidden love, lu-lu-lu-lu. ♪

00:13:50.050 --> 00:13:55.060
♪ Kimuchi is intruding, lu-lu-lu-lu. ♪

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:58.900
--♪ What will happen to
Rei-kun, lu-lu-lu-lu? ♪
--I know I'm hearing a voice,
like somebody is singing.

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:00.230
--♪ What will happen to
Rei-kun, lu-lu-lu-lu? ♪
--You're hearing things, I tell you.

00:14:00.230 --> 00:14:03.150
Asako-san, are you sure you're
not just jumpy about the show?

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:04.900
Good boys and girls don't dance in the car.

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:05.820
"It's dangerous to dance in the car"

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:05.780
That goes for bad boys and girls, too.

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:08.240
"This is a nice place."

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:09.490
"You like it?"

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:16.910
"It's every girl's dream to have
their wedding in a place like this."

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:19.580
"I'm glad to hear you say that, Asako-san."

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:21.920
That's what they're saying. Over.

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:27.300
W- what kind of development
is this!? I'll smash them!

00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:29.430
Calm down, I tell you.

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:31.600
Say, would you say your line?

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:32.390
You mean here?

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:33.220
Yes!

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:34.560
Okay, sure.

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:38.560
For you, I would gather
the stardust from the night sky,

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:41.730
and scrape up enough
to get you everything you want.

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:44.900
No, there's only one thing that I want.

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:45.900
What's that?

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:49.570
To see myself reflected
in your eyes. That's all.

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:52.160
What schmaltz! This is beyond hammy!

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:57.750
Are you happy?

00:14:57.750 --> 00:14:59.500
Yes, very.

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:00.580
Asako!

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:07.260
Asako!!

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:11.430
Could you remain calm,
even if it came to this?

00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:12.590
Er...

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:14.600
You are Sana's manager.

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:18.430
Wherever you are, at all times, you
have to think about Sana above all else.

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:20.270
I don't mean to keep harping on this,

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:21.600
but a manager has to always
look out for the talent...

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:25.770
This lecture has been going on since
yesterday. That's not harping on it?

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:28.280
Are you listening to me, Sagami!?

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:29.280
Yes...

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:32.030
I hear that Asako-san has
a kissing scene in this drama.

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:35.870
You are upset over that, aren't you?

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:39.710
No, not at all. That's silly.

00:15:39.710 --> 00:15:41.540
I couldn't possibly be...

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:47.800
Right. She is an actress. One kiss
scene won't... one kiss scene won't...

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:55.220
Oh, Sagami-kun...

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:57.560
It's not like that! My...

00:15:57.560 --> 00:16:01.390
My relationship with
Asako is not like that!

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:10.070
My... my relationship with Asako...

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:13.320
...is a relationship where you trust each
other, is that what you're trying to say?

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:14.240
Mm-hmm.

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:21.910
Right now, the two of them are
enjoying a romantic dinnertime. Over.

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:25.000
Copy that. Continue
your surveillance. Over.

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:31.590
So they're finally shooting
the kiss scene tomorrow, huh?

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:33.840
A kiss is all in a day's
work for an actress.

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:36.050
You don't get it!

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:40.390
An actress has to create a lot of
feeling in order to play her role right.

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:42.850
They begin to like their
counterpart more and more.

00:16:43.560 --> 00:16:48.020
That could be... that could be why
Asako-san has come to love Kimuchi-kun!

00:16:48.070 --> 00:16:50.190
You mean she's not kissing
him because she loves him,

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:52.070
she loves him because she's kissing him?

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:57.410
Y- yikes... I just remembered
something weird...

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:01.370
No, no! I didn't do that!
It was done to me!

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:03.580
And Hayama isn't the type to kiss just
because he doesn't hate someone, anyhow!

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:05.540
--What are you getting so agitated over?
--Okay, no more, no more!

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:07.210
No more talking about that!
No more! No more! No more!

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:08.590
There's just no calming you down.

00:17:08.590 --> 00:17:10.710
The two of them are leaving
the restaurant. Over.

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:13.880
All right, at this point,
it's time to press them directly!

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:15.590
Could we have a moment, please?

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:19.600
Um...

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:21.390
The rumors about you getting
married are true, then?

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:22.600
Well, uh...

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:25.560
No you don't! Even if those two
really are seeing each other,

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:27.230
if Rei-kun ever found out...

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:29.610
Tsuyoshi-kun, distract
them by dancing! Over.

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:31.610
Huh? But I can't dance.

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:34.190
Never mind that, just dance! Over!

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:36.530
What's the use?

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:41.540
Hello! I'm a strange young man who dances
everywhere... everywhere... everywhere...

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:45.710
It's no use! I'm too embarrassed!

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:48.880
There are fools who dance,
and the fools who watch them!

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:50.000
Do I have to come with you?

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:53.880
♪ Sneaking photos of them on their date? ♪

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:56.220
♪ How boorish of you-hoo-hoo-hoo-hoo! ♪

00:17:56.220 --> 00:17:58.220
♪ They brought the kids
along on tonight's date! ♪

00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:00.550
♪ Everything's aboveboard here,
hoo-hoo-hoo-hoo! ♪

00:18:00.550 --> 00:18:01.890
S- Sana-chan?

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:07.390
Okay, you reporters, that's all for
tonight. See you again next week!

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:13.070
Goodbye! There's nothing tasty to see here!

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:19.570
Nothing tasty to see here,
you say? Don't be ridiculous.

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:20.910
Who are you?

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:22.910
If this is your first appearance,
you should identify yourself.

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:32.960
Sana-chan...

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:34.500
What are you doing here?

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:37.470
More reporters and such could
still come barging in on you.

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:42.180
In any case, you should go home
for the rest of the night, okay?

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:44.180
Y- yeah...

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:46.930
T- that guy from before... was scary!

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:46.850
"And so, the day of the drama filming..."

00:18:46.930 --> 00:18:48.890
Okay, this is a take! Start!

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:53.860
For you, I would gather
the stardust from the night sky,

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:56.860
and scrape up enough to get
you everything you want.

00:18:56.860 --> 00:18:59.860
No, there's only one thing that I want.

00:18:59.860 --> 00:19:01.870
What's that?

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:05.540
To see myself reflected
in your eyes. That's all.

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:08.040
"Child's Toy"!

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:11.210
--Come on, come on, "Child's Toy"!
Watch "Child's Toy"!
--Cut! What's going on here!?

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:12.710
Throw these guys out of here!

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:15.880
Pinch "Child's Toy"!
Touch "Child's Toy"!

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:19.550
Come on, come on, let it all
hang out and watch "Child's Toy"!

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:26.010
Rei!

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:30.690
Okay, we're done,
we're done! Rei-kun!

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:32.850
Thank goodness the car is fixed, huh?
Let's go, let's go!

00:19:32.850 --> 00:19:36.530
Sorry, Sana-chan, but would
you take the train home today?

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:43.030
Rei-kun...

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:47.790
I trust you... I trust you...
I trust you!

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:54.540
I'm home.

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:56.550
Welcome back. Where's Sagami-kun?

00:19:56.550 --> 00:19:58.210
Apparently, he wanted to be alone.

00:19:58.210 --> 00:20:00.220
There's supposed to be a press
conference on TV tonight.

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:02.050
Kimuchi-kun is going to
announce he's getting married.

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:14.230
I trust you, Asako.
ltrust you,

00:20:14.230 --> 00:20:18.900
but I don't want to see you
in any kissing scenes!

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:20.070
W- what!?

00:20:21.240 --> 00:20:24.240
Mama! It's cruel to make
Rei-kun watch this!

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:26.580
He's going to find out sometime,
anyhow. As long as he is,

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:30.080
we might as well enjoy it with
the full force of the big screen!

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:31.200
Mama...

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:32.500
Cut!

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:34.500
Great job, everyone!

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:38.170
Yeah, that was terrific, Asako-chan!
I was thinking, for our next drama...

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:41.170
I'm in a hurry, so if you'll excuse me...

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:42.840
Nice working with you.

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:44.010
Kimuchi-kun...

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:46.680
I have a press conference to get to,
so if you'll excuse me...

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:48.180
Nice working with you.

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:49.850
And here, I'm the director...

00:20:49.850 --> 00:20:52.850
Even the director is just another man,
once the production is over.

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:55.190
Can you see me? Can you see Babbit?
Huh? Huh? Huh? Huh?

00:20:57.020 --> 00:21:02.990
Well, it's about to begin. Sagami-kun,
watch this with your eyes wide open!

00:20:57.270 --> 00:21:00.480
"Special News Bulletin
Kimuchi Takuya Urgent Press Conference"

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:06.200
Now that my drama has finished
shooting without incident,

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:09.700
I would like to announce to
everyone that I am getting married.

00:21:12.870 --> 00:21:17.830
Let's see... Kurumi Asako-san,
whom I'm sure you all know...

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:21.710
...is not my fiancée.

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:24.880
My fiancee is someone famous
for being the queen of quiz shows,

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:26.220
Obana Miho-san.

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:27.800
I- I'm Obana.

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:30.560
Wha-?

00:21:30.560 --> 00:21:31.890
What kind of joke is this?

00:21:31.890 --> 00:21:33.890
Well, I guess that's how it goes.

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:39.310
Rei!

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:41.230
Asako!

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:42.360
I- I'm Obana.

00:21:43.570 --> 00:21:45.320
I made you a promise, didn't I?

00:21:45.320 --> 00:21:47.700
That once the drama was over,
I would come see you first?

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:48.740
Uh-huh.

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:53.580
W- what's going on here!?
I didn't hear anything about this!

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:55.330
If you made that kind of promise,

00:21:55.330 --> 00:21:58.500
then I don't know what I was so
worried about, do I? Do I? Do I?

00:21:59.920 --> 00:22:02.920
Rei, did those rumors about
Kimuchi-kun bother you?

00:22:02.920 --> 00:22:05.590
A little. But I trusted you.

00:22:05.590 --> 00:22:08.090
What are you two doing, going off
into your own little world!?

00:22:08.090 --> 00:22:09.470
Hey! No more kidding around!

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:13.600
Once I become a full-fledged actress...

00:22:13.600 --> 00:22:16.890
Once I become a full-fledged manager...

00:22:17.940 --> 00:22:19.270
Let's hold our own...

00:22:19.270 --> 00:22:20.440
...press conference.

00:22:21.610 --> 00:22:24.070
I can't stand this! Hey!

00:22:29.320 --> 00:22:33.580
Kurata Sana, you're going to
rock the weekly tabloids next!

00:22:33.580 --> 00:22:36.500
Hey, can you see Babbit?
Who exactly are you?

00:22:36.500 --> 00:22:37.790
C- cut it out.

00:22:40.670 --> 00:22:42.130
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.630 --> 00:22:47.670
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:48.930 --> 00:22:52.390
In dire straits,

00:22:53.140 --> 00:22:55.970
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:56.470 --> 00:22:59.850
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:00.810 --> 00:23:04.940
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:05.150 --> 00:23:10.990
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:11.240 --> 00:23:13.200
...panic!!

00:23:14.240 --> 00:23:19.080
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:19.290 --> 00:23:21.750
he's there.

00:23:22.670 --> 00:23:25.000
And our usual classroom...

00:23:25.210 --> 00:23:27.630
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.670 --> 00:23:30.090
...for two.

00:23:30.930 --> 00:23:33.550
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.760 --> 00:23:38.310
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:39.230 --> 00:23:41.900
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:42.100 --> 00:23:46.610
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:47.530 --> 00:23:52.200
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:52.360 --> 00:23:54.870
he's there,

00:23:55.830 --> 00:23:58.040
And our usual classroom...

00:23:58.290 --> 00:24:00.620
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.750 --> 00:24:03.120
...for two.

00:24:06.670 --> 00:24:09.340
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:09.340 --> 00:24:12.340
There are many pesky entertainment
reporters in the world,

00:24:12.340 --> 00:24:15.350
but this reporter who just showed up
is in a league all his own!

00:24:15.350 --> 00:24:17.350
He's an incredibly heavy snake-reporter!

00:24:17.350 --> 00:24:21.020
I'm surprised that he even took
a picture of Hayama kissing me.

00:24:21.020 --> 00:24:23.190
It's been a long time since
I've seriously gotten this mad!

00:24:23.190 --> 00:24:27.150
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha, Episode 31,
the "Photos, Cooking, and Dinosaurs" saga,

00:24:27.150 --> 00:24:30.690
The Snake Stomps In
With His Shoes Still On

00:24:30.690 --> 00:24:34.570
Babbit has a close call, too!
I hate snakes, after all.
